{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">[收录于&nbsp; <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/news/2558/content00896?type=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em><strong>#<span style=\"color: #c91623; text-decoration: underline;\">一体化</span>供应链-标准解决方案</strong></em></span></a> 合集]</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">行业痛点与方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">行业痛点</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;1 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>企业扩大经营规模，</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">备货资金紧张</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;2 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>急需外币入账及结算</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;3 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>企业持续经营、产品销售，需频繁出入库</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"background-color: #c91623;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;4 </span></strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span>融资周期长，</span></em><em><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">易错过销售黄金期</span></em></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;1 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>跨境金融、盘活仓内货品，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">释放流动资金</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;2 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>支持多币种放款及结算</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;3 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>仓库执行动态质押监管，</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">企业运营无压力</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; background-color: #2576e8;\">&nbsp;4 <span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span>流程简单，一</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">经审批、随时支取</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #2576e8;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">跨境融资解决方案</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">服务对象为与京东物流合作仓储业务的各类京东国际pop商家，融资是指以商家自有的动产为质押的授信业务。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/123026/29/35428/74456/63ef32c0F5bea81ca/1a395c4229712b9d.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">成功案例</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">香港某母婴旗舰店</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">香港某母婴旗舰店，在618年中大促前期，备货急需大量的资金周转，美元融资需求强烈。通过将保税仓内的商品抵押至合作银行，并由京东物流全程监管，短时间内提取美元入账，大促期间销量陡增。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/117468/38/32865/124317/63ef32caF0298c04e/e942e7ff155edf42.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://getwuce.jdl.com/#/diyForm?formCode=BD3187402377390195328&amp;channelL1Code=l1-ch8&amp;channelCode=wucech87219\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/vendor/wlimg10.360buyimg.com/jdwlcms/jfs/t1/50750/6/19114/43354/63f2dc02F73d74f9d/da1a7fc9b5c408ea.png\" /></a></p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content01071", "contentTitle": "供应链金融-跨境融资 京东国际POP商融